(1, 'Gasteroids', 'Birds Nest Fungi, Earthballs, Earthstars, Puffballs, and Stinkhorns', 'The term "gasteroid" refers to an informal, polyphyletic grouping of fungi whose classification is based on the shared characteristic of having their spores develop internally within a closed fruiting body (gasterothecium), rather than a monophyletic taxonomic group with a single common ancestor. ', '2025-09-23 11:39:52.000000', '2025-12-01 13:38:53.989877'),
