(282, 'FCC00282', 'Aroma', 'The first thing that can be done after photography is an aroma test. Smell the mushroom as it is. Then, briefly rub a mushroom cap and the stem and smell again. You can also cut the mushroom and immediately perform a smell test. Record these aromas (almond-like, bakery-like, like dark cacao chocolate, apricot-like, like frozen orange juice, “normal/common,” cucumber-like, anise-like, garlic-like, coal-tar-like, radish-like, cedar-like, bleach-like, spermatic, shrimp-like, maraschino-cherry-like, acrid, etc.). | Aroma and flavor [See dedicated section further down]', NULL, 2, 26, 8, 56, '2026-11-25 00:00:00.000000', '2026-11-25 00:00:00.000000', NULL, '{"name_scientific": "Odor", "xde_lines": [189, 122], "legacy_ids": [316, 782], "legacy_names": ["Aroma", "aroma"], "common": true, "review_resolved": ["Includes old fungus-type character \\"aroma\\""]}', 0),
(283, 'FCC00283', 'Aroma When Rubbed', 'The first thing that can be done after photography is an aroma test. Smell the mushroom as it is. Then, briefly rub a mushroom cap and the stem and smell again. You can also cut the mushroom and immediately perform a smell test. Record these aromas (almond-like, bakery-like, like dark cacao chocolate, apricot-like, like frozen orange juice, “normal/common,” cucumber-like, anise-like, garlic-like, coal-tar-like, radish-like, cedar-like, bleach-like, spermatic, shrimp-like, maraschino-cherry-like, acrid, etc.).', 'Values as Aroma.', 2, 26, 8, 56, '2026-11-25 00:00:00.000000', '2026-11-25 00:00:00.000000', NULL, '{"name_scientific": "Odor When Rubbed", "xde_lines": [189]}', 0),
(284, 'FCC00284', 'Aroma When Cut', 'The first thing that can be done after photography is an aroma test. Smell the mushroom as it is. Then, briefly rub a mushroom cap and the stem and smell again. You can also cut the mushroom and immediately perform a smell test. Record these aromas (almond-like, bakery-like, like dark cacao chocolate, apricot-like, like frozen orange juice, “normal/common,” cucumber-like, anise-like, garlic-like, coal-tar-like, radish-like, cedar-like, bleach-like, spermatic, shrimp-like, maraschino-cherry-like, acrid, etc.).', 'Values as Aroma.', 2, 26, 8, 56, '2026-11-25 00:00:00.000000', '2026-11-25 00:00:00.000000', NULL, '{"name_scientific": "Odor When Cut", "xde_lines": [189]}', 0),
(285, 'FCC00285', 'Taste', 'The next thing you can do is a taste test. If you have a digestive sensitivity, I cannot ethically recommend performing this test. Do not eat or swallow any material. To conduct the test, nibble a very small piece of mushroom material, and very briefly try to get a flavor description (mildly bitter, acrid, gourmet, spicy, none, common, etc.). All of the material is then spit out. Hands and mouth are then thoroughly rinsed. | Aroma and flavor [See dedicated section further down]', NULL, 2, 26, 7, 56, '2026-11-25 00:00:00.000000', '2026-11-25 00:00:00.000000', NULL, '{"name_scientific": "Taste", "xde_lines": [191, 122], "legacy_ids": [5, 781], "legacy_names": ["Taste", "taste"], "common": true, "review_resolved": ["Includes old fungus-type character \\"taste\\""]}', 0),
